# Quality and testing

Authoritative: `standards/TESTING.md`.

- Add tests for security and privacy-sensitive logic when code exists.
- Validator tests must include positive and negative cases.
- Do not ship scripts that always exit 0 without checks.
- Mark gates NOT_IMPLEMENTED with activation criteria when app code is absent.
- Completion reports must list real test and CI outcomes.
